WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.788
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.058 --> 00:19.311
[theme music playing]

3
00:26.527 --> 00:28.320
[liquid bubbling]

4
00:32.658 --> 00:35.327
[clinking, rattling]

5
00:35.453 --> 00:36.579
[cat meows]

6
00:37.496 --> 00:39.623
[hoofbeats]

7
00:41.250 --> 00:42.168
[water splashes]

8
00:49.049 --> 00:51.051
[handcuffs rattling, click]

9
00:55.097 --> 00:56.390
[pen clicking]

10
00:56.474 --> 00:59.310
A WEEK BEFORE THE MANAGEMENT AWARDS

11
00:59.894 --> 01:02.104
[Da-woon] Ms. Han, have you reviewed Mr. Yoon's business trip schedule?

12
01:02.438 --> 01:04.190
He needs it by this afternoon…

13
01:04.565 --> 01:06.233
[Yi-jun] Draft the memory equipment investment plan

14
01:06.317 --> 01:08.360
and send it to me by end of week.

15
01:10.696 --> 01:12.406
[Ms. Han] Two people have asked for confirmation

16
01:12.490 --> 01:15.159
on the retained earnings that Mr. Yoon is investigating…

17
01:15.910 --> 01:17.661
Yoon Na-jung…

18
01:17.745 --> 01:19.914
and Na Man-seok.

19
01:19.997 --> 01:22.917
[tense music playing]

20
01:34.261 --> 01:38.349
Immediately after Eun-young's murder, they went to see the chairman.

21
01:40.434 --> 01:43.103
Uh-huh. Okay, I think that's all for now.

22
01:48.692 --> 01:50.861
[Hye-jung] And not long after Yoon Na-jung came and left…

23
01:50.945 --> 01:51.904
[phone buzzing]

24
01:53.531 --> 01:55.449
…Na Man-seok stepped into the room.

25
01:57.076 --> 02:00.120
[tense music continues]

26
02:00.996 --> 02:01.872
And then…

27
02:03.916 --> 02:06.585
[Mr. Na] Cover this up as fast as you can, sir.

28
02:06.669 --> 02:08.504
[Hye-jung] …he gave the chairman the same advice,

29
02:08.587 --> 02:10.381
telling him to cover everything up.

30
02:10.464 --> 02:11.465
[music fades]

31
02:13.300 --> 02:15.177
They pretended to worry about company reputation,

32
02:15.261 --> 02:17.513
about Mr. Yoon being named a suspect, but--

33
02:17.596 --> 02:19.181
But that wasn't their real concern.

34
02:20.975 --> 02:22.643
If the police started digging,

35
02:22.726 --> 02:24.353
the embezzled slush fund would be uncovered.

36
02:31.694 --> 02:32.653
Just thinking…

37
02:33.737 --> 02:35.698
if the word gets out that this is evidence…

38
02:35.781 --> 02:37.825
[tense, dramatic music playing]

39
02:39.326 --> 02:40.744
…what's the reaction?

40
02:42.454 --> 02:43.747
We use this as a lure?

41
02:45.708 --> 02:48.377
The guilty ones will get nervous and show their hand.

42
02:48.460 --> 02:51.422
The rumor needs to sound real for them to get nervous.

43
02:51.505 --> 02:53.048
Then we'll think of a good one.

44
02:53.674 --> 02:54.633
And this way,

45
02:55.217 --> 02:58.137
we can find out just how close their ties with the cops are.

46
03:00.431 --> 03:03.559
[Yi-jun] The guilty ones will get nervous and show their hand.

47
03:03.642 --> 03:07.980
We can find out just how close their ties with the cops are.

48
03:08.355 --> 03:10.065
He's gonna try and use us?

49
03:10.900 --> 03:12.693
[Captain Park sighs deeply]

50
03:13.444 --> 03:14.361
SEOUL METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

51
03:14.445 --> 03:15.362
DAY OF MANAGEMENT AWARDS EVENT

52
03:15.446 --> 03:16.447
[Hye-jung] I came in today

53
03:16.530 --> 03:19.033
because I remembered something I forgot to say earlier.

54
03:19.116 --> 03:22.494
I'd given Eun-young a pen with a built-in voice recorder,

55
03:22.995 --> 03:24.079
and I found it.

56
03:24.204 --> 03:25.915
You're submitting it as evidence?

57
03:25.998 --> 03:26.999
It's not on her now.

58
03:28.250 --> 03:30.669
We gave it to Mr. Yoon because he requested it, sir.

59
03:33.672 --> 03:34.840
So what was recorded?

60
03:35.424 --> 03:36.467
Did you listen?

61
03:36.550 --> 03:37.885
I didn't.

62
03:37.968 --> 03:40.220
[tense, investigative music playing]

63
03:51.482 --> 03:53.108
[music fades]

64
03:58.238 --> 04:00.199
-[phone chirps, line rings] -[sighs]

65
04:00.282 --> 04:02.451
She's got more than files, it turns out.

66
04:02.534 --> 04:04.745
She also has a pen with a voice recorder.

67
04:06.455 --> 04:08.999
She hasn't heard what's stored on there. [sighs]

68
04:12.419 --> 04:13.712
[door keypad beeping]

69
04:13.796 --> 04:15.130
[door lock chimes]

70
04:20.761 --> 04:22.513
[door lock chimes]

71
04:26.684 --> 04:29.520
[suspenseful music playing]

72
04:32.022 --> 04:35.901
[intense music playing]

73
04:39.697 --> 04:41.407
-[thuds] -[grunts]

74
04:41.740 --> 04:45.536
Hye-jung, it's me. Wake up. Lee Hye-jung! Can you--

75
04:45.619 --> 04:48.163
Are you people insane? What were you doing?!

76
04:48.455 --> 04:49.790
-Hye-jung. -Call 119.

77
04:49.873 --> 04:51.875
Hye-jung? Hye-jung.

78
04:51.959 --> 04:53.836
Hey, can you hear me? Hye-jung.

79
04:55.462 --> 04:57.256
Are you awake? Hey!

80
04:57.339 --> 04:59.425
[Si-hyun breathes anxiously]

81
04:59.508 --> 05:01.552
She's awake now? She's okay?

82
05:01.635 --> 05:03.637
[tense, dramatic music playing]

83
05:05.597 --> 05:06.765
Did they break in here?

84
05:07.933 --> 05:10.060
Did you get a good look? Anything?

85
05:15.441 --> 05:16.692
Tattoo. Tattoo!

86
05:17.067 --> 05:18.027
[Captain Park] Show her the photo.

87
05:20.654 --> 05:21.780
Did you see this?

88
05:23.866 --> 05:24.742
[weakly] Yeah…

89
05:24.825 --> 05:26.785
-Look around, they might be nearby. -Right.

90
05:27.327 --> 05:30.080
-[sighs deeply] -Who… who did this?

91
05:30.164 --> 05:32.750
Same prick who was lurking around Park Min-hwan's house.

92
05:32.833 --> 05:35.836
[tense, dramatic music continues]

93
05:44.636 --> 05:46.638
[tense, dramatic music rises]

94
05:51.810 --> 05:53.520
[breathing heavily]

95
05:53.604 --> 05:54.980
-[laughs sinisterly] -[host] We'll be kicking off

96
05:55.064 --> 05:58.317
the 2026 Korea Leadership and Management Awards Ceremony

97
05:58.400 --> 06:02.654
with an opening speech from Taekang Group's Mr. Yoon Yi-jun.

98
06:03.447 --> 06:05.449
-[breathing shakily] -[uneasy music playing]

99
06:08.577 --> 06:10.579
[phone buzzes]

100
06:14.958 --> 06:16.585
-[panting] Yeah. -[Si-hyun] If I'd arrived any later,

101
06:16.668 --> 06:18.504
Hye-jung could've suffered the same fate.

102
06:18.587 --> 06:19.880
Ms. Lee…

103
06:21.006 --> 06:21.882
she what?

104
06:21.965 --> 06:23.675
[Si-hyun] Is everything all right over there?

105
06:25.427 --> 06:26.345
[gasps]

106
06:26.428 --> 06:28.055
Sir, we have to go in now.

107
06:29.723 --> 06:30.766
Kang Jae-hee.

108
06:31.350 --> 06:32.893
[panting]

109
06:32.976 --> 06:35.395
[suspenseful music playing]

110
06:36.522 --> 06:38.816
[motorcycle engine revs]

111
06:51.912 --> 06:53.247
[panting] We gotta catch that bastard.

112
06:55.165 --> 06:57.626
[tense, dramatic music playing]

113
07:00.587 --> 07:04.216
[camera shutters clicking rapidly]

114
07:04.299 --> 07:05.801
Sir, get up, now.

115
07:06.802 --> 07:09.346
Hey, someone stop them!

116
07:10.222 --> 07:12.558
[panting]

117
07:13.100 --> 07:14.852
[Da-woon] Put those cameras away.

118
07:14.935 --> 07:15.978
[camera shutters clicking rapidly]

119
07:16.061 --> 07:17.980
I said, put those cameras away.

120
07:18.063 --> 07:19.731
Have you been hurt at all, sir?

121
07:20.816 --> 07:21.817
No, you?

122
07:23.694 --> 07:25.988
[Da-woon] Stop it! Someone make them leave!

123
07:26.071 --> 07:28.031
Hey, did you hear me? I told you to stop.

124
07:28.115 --> 07:31.076
-[indistinct chatter] -[worried breathing]

125
07:31.160 --> 07:33.162
[unsettling music playing]

126
07:37.374 --> 07:39.001
[host] We regret to inform you that the opening speech

127
07:39.084 --> 07:42.045
for the 2026 Korea Leadership and Management Awards Ceremony

128
07:42.129 --> 07:44.131
has been canceled, due to unforeseen circumstances.

129
07:44.214 --> 07:45.841
We're truly sorry about this.

130
07:45.924 --> 07:49.553
So, um, in just a few moments, we'll resume our official itinerary,

131
07:49.636 --> 07:52.014
and we'll start by introducing our distinguished guests

132
07:52.097 --> 07:54.224
who've flown in from around the world.

133
07:57.436 --> 07:59.688
-[music fades] -[Jae-hee sighs]

134
08:03.483 --> 08:04.735
Let me do an inspection.

135
08:11.116 --> 08:12.451
Are you okay?

136
08:16.538 --> 08:19.166
Did you get hurt? Nothing, right?

137
08:22.294 --> 08:23.212
[sighs]

138
08:24.379 --> 08:25.964
God, what a relief…

139
08:28.467 --> 08:29.760
Don't ever do that again.

140
08:30.510 --> 08:32.304
Stop jumping into harm's way like that.

141
08:33.472 --> 08:34.598
It's not worth it.

142
08:36.642 --> 08:37.976
Sir, you're one to talk.

143
08:38.852 --> 08:40.145
Don't do it either.

144
08:40.229 --> 08:42.022
[soft dramatic music playing]

145
08:42.105 --> 08:45.525
It's my sworn duty to protect. You have no reason to do it.

146
08:47.611 --> 08:49.196
-Why? -[Jae-hee] Listen…

147
08:49.279 --> 08:51.823
I get millions of won per month for what I do.

148
08:51.907 --> 08:56.161
I'm doing my job. My salary's in proportion to the risk.

149
09:00.832 --> 09:02.668
That was just you doing your job?

150
09:03.710 --> 09:06.255
Yes. That's why I'm saying,

151
09:06.755 --> 09:09.049
you shouldn't be taking these risks.

152
09:09.549 --> 09:11.009
Please let me do what I do.

153
09:11.093 --> 09:12.052
Stop it.

154
09:19.893 --> 09:21.603
I told you this was dangerous.

155
09:22.521 --> 09:25.691
If you keep provoking them like this, you'll only be targeted more.

156
09:25.774 --> 09:26.858
You just witnessed it.

157
09:26.942 --> 09:28.110
You once asked…

158
09:30.195 --> 09:32.072
why I hired you when I did.

159
09:32.155 --> 09:33.907
[somber piano music playing]

160
09:34.658 --> 09:36.994
It was because I needed a personal protector.

161
09:37.577 --> 09:39.788
And I was lucky enough to end up with you.

162
09:43.834 --> 09:44.918
That's why…

163
09:47.087 --> 09:49.089
I can't stand the thought of you getting hurt.

164
09:51.258 --> 09:53.135
So don't start saying things like,

165
09:53.218 --> 09:55.304
"That's just my job," when you don't mean it.

166
09:55.387 --> 09:57.389
[somber piano music continues]

167
10:00.726 --> 10:01.810
[Jae-hee sighs]

168
10:05.897 --> 10:06.815
Come on, sir…

169
10:10.277 --> 10:11.903
I ask you as a favor…

170
10:16.825 --> 10:18.493
don't put yourself in danger.

171
10:41.433 --> 10:42.434
[music ends]

172
10:44.102 --> 10:45.354
EPISODE 8

173
10:45.437 --> 10:47.731
[Si-hyun] Just for a little bit, just relax, okay? Come on.

174
10:47.814 --> 10:48.815
[door lock chimes]

175
10:49.858 --> 10:51.234
Okay. Here. Come in, come in.

176
10:52.611 --> 10:54.237
-[door closes] -Close the door.

177
10:54.321 --> 10:55.614
[door lock chimes]

178
10:57.074 --> 10:58.784
I told you I'm fine with a hotel.

179
10:59.409 --> 11:01.453
Then think of this as a hotel, but better, I promise.

180
11:01.536 --> 11:02.704
I'll go stay with my friend.

181
11:02.788 --> 11:04.164
Oh, nice try.

182
11:04.247 --> 11:06.500
We both know you don't have any friends.

183
11:08.251 --> 11:09.628
-[scoffs] -You want something warm?

184
11:09.711 --> 11:10.962
Some tea? Milk?

185
11:11.046 --> 11:13.465
I could get you some meds to help you relax a little.

186
11:13.548 --> 11:14.424
[Hye-jung] I'm fine.

187
11:15.675 --> 11:17.344
How about you just gimme a hug?

188
11:18.011 --> 11:19.846
[soft romantic music playing]

189
11:21.306 --> 11:22.140
You don't have to.

190
11:27.521 --> 11:31.066
[heart pounding]

191
11:31.650 --> 11:34.778
Sorta seems like you're the one who probably needs to relax.

192
11:36.029 --> 11:37.197
Your heart's beating loud.

193
11:37.697 --> 11:39.449
[grunts] That's 'cause…

194
11:40.325 --> 11:42.244
-you were just… -[Hye-jung chuckles]

195
11:43.912 --> 11:45.163
Were you choking up just now?

196
11:46.331 --> 11:48.708
A little longer and you would've started crying.

197
11:50.710 --> 11:53.463
-Who'd start crying? Huh? -[chuckles]

198
11:55.715 --> 11:56.925
I'll take these off.

199
11:59.177 --> 12:00.220
All right.

200
12:01.179 --> 12:03.974
I see you found those. I took them out just for you.

201
12:05.016 --> 12:06.685
[music fades]

202
12:09.729 --> 12:11.857
[dark music playing]

203
12:12.441 --> 12:13.567
[young Yi-jun] Mom.

204
12:14.359 --> 12:15.694
Mom!

205
12:15.777 --> 12:16.987
Mom, wake up!

206
12:17.070 --> 12:18.864
[thunder rumbling]

207
12:19.531 --> 12:21.533
[groans]

208
12:21.616 --> 12:25.787
Mom. Mom, why aren't you waking up?

209
12:26.413 --> 12:28.123
Mom, can you hear me?

210
12:29.416 --> 12:33.003
[gentle somber music playing]

211
12:38.049 --> 12:40.343
[Captain Park] You're a police officer working undercover!

212
12:41.553 --> 12:43.847
[Seok-jin] I believe you, but he shouldn't do that.

213
12:45.682 --> 12:47.684
[Yi-jun] Everything went pitch black…

214
12:48.518 --> 12:50.645
and all I could think about was you.

215
12:52.731 --> 12:54.024
Could we just…

216
12:55.525 --> 12:57.110
stay like this for a while?

217
12:57.194 --> 12:58.778
I ask you as a favor…

218
12:59.988 --> 13:02.991
[gentle somber music continues]

219
13:03.783 --> 13:05.327
…don't put yourself in danger.

220
13:05.827 --> 13:08.205
[panting]

221
13:11.750 --> 13:13.502
-[music fades] -[sighs]

222
13:16.046 --> 13:17.297
[Captain Park sighs deeply]

223
13:17.380 --> 13:21.468
[phone buzzes]

224
13:23.803 --> 13:25.096
-Uh-huh. -[Jae-hee] Sir, that delivery bike,

225
13:25.180 --> 13:26.806
what's the license plate number?

226
13:26.890 --> 13:28.308
Ugh, I'm tired…

227
13:28.892 --> 13:30.060
Did you look into it?

228
13:32.103 --> 13:34.231
[sighs] We've confirmed the owner, all right?

229
13:34.314 --> 13:35.941
I need that number by 10:00, Captain.

230
13:36.024 --> 13:37.025
[panting]

231
13:37.108 --> 13:38.318
[call ends]

232
13:41.321 --> 13:42.489
[sighs]

233
13:42.656 --> 13:45.367
[groaning]

234
13:45.450 --> 13:47.410
[sighs] What is wrong with her?

235
13:47.494 --> 13:50.288
My God, when's that lunatic's battery gonna run out?

236
13:50.372 --> 13:53.208
DAILY REPAYMENT NO FEES

237
13:55.710 --> 13:57.045
[deliveryman grunts]

238
13:57.128 --> 13:58.213
EXPRESS DELIVERY SERVICE

239
13:58.296 --> 13:59.256
[exhales]

240
13:59.339 --> 14:01.508
You know I'm busy. Why'd you call me in?

241
14:01.591 --> 14:04.052
-What's going on? -He's here.

242
14:06.137 --> 14:07.222
-[snoring] -Detective!

243
14:07.305 --> 14:09.015
[snorts, grunts]

244
14:10.100 --> 14:11.184
[grunts]

245
14:13.728 --> 14:14.980
Oh…

246
14:15.063 --> 14:17.732
[deliveryman sighs] I already told you I don't remember.

247
14:17.816 --> 14:21.236
I do dozens of deliveries per day. How do you expect me to know this?

248
14:21.319 --> 14:23.321
I wonder if this'll jog your memory.

249
14:23.405 --> 14:24.781
[clears throat] Look.

250
14:24.864 --> 14:27.909
[tense music playing]

251
14:29.703 --> 14:31.329
So if this guy's you…

252
14:31.997 --> 14:33.707
how 'bout you give me a nod.

253
14:33.790 --> 14:35.250
Take a look.

254
14:37.919 --> 14:39.129
That woman there…

255
14:40.213 --> 14:41.673
she was really insistent.

256
14:41.756 --> 14:42.924
And, uh…

257
14:44.593 --> 14:48.179
I got paid 300K on top of my rate.

258
14:48.263 --> 14:50.640
All I really did was make the delivery, and that was it.

259
14:50.724 --> 14:52.267
So why did you run?

260
14:52.350 --> 14:55.145
Hey, in this line of work, you develop a sixth sense for stuff,

261
14:55.228 --> 14:56.479
and guess what?

262
14:56.563 --> 14:58.565
Prick came after me like a bat outta hell.

263
14:58.648 --> 15:00.150
What was I supposed to do?

264
15:00.233 --> 15:01.526
So the guy went after you?

265
15:01.610 --> 15:02.527
Yeah.

266
15:03.069 --> 15:05.363
[tense music swells, fades]

267
15:06.281 --> 15:07.824
[employee 1] Did you see this?

268
15:07.907 --> 15:09.242
Check it out.

269
15:10.201 --> 15:11.745
-You saw that video? -Yeah, I was shocked, too.

270
15:11.828 --> 15:13.663
[phone keyboard clicking]

271
15:13.747 --> 15:16.291
-[Captain Park sighs] -[phone buzzes]

272
15:16.374 --> 15:17.459
[Jae-hee] Did you look into it?

273
15:17.542 --> 15:19.002
Was it Yoon Na-jung?

274
15:19.085 --> 15:20.795
Sounds like someone's had enough caffeine today.

275
15:20.879 --> 15:21.713
YES, IT WAS

276
15:21.796 --> 15:23.006
Where's all this energy coming from?

277
15:24.424 --> 15:26.176
Han Eun-young's killer used the same methods,

278
15:26.259 --> 15:28.011
and it's from another lefty.

279
15:28.094 --> 15:30.013
Even though she was guarded by a security detail,

280
15:30.096 --> 15:30.972
they broke into her house.

281
15:31.056 --> 15:33.642
You had enough caffeine? Huh?

282
15:33.725 --> 15:35.018
Let's just finish eating, huh?

283
15:36.269 --> 15:37.228
[phone buzzes]

284
15:37.312 --> 15:38.647
I'LL LOOK INTO MS. CHOI

285
15:38.730 --> 15:40.440
The theory checks out, Kang's right.

286
15:40.523 --> 15:42.484
Na-jung's infiltrating Yi-jun's inner circle.

287
15:42.567 --> 15:44.694
It's not just the express delivery couriers.

288
15:44.778 --> 15:47.113
Let's look into Myeong-suk. I'm sure that would turn up something--

289
15:47.197 --> 15:49.366
You really think I haven't thought of all these things?

290
15:50.200 --> 15:52.661
"Look before you leap," you ever heard of that?

291
15:52.786 --> 15:55.330
Let's finish eating. Go on, eat. Do it.

292
15:55.997 --> 15:57.791
One last thing. I'm worried about Kang.

293
15:58.833 --> 16:00.001
I think she might get hurt.

294
16:00.835 --> 16:04.005
You can handle the Myeong-suk thing. It'll be yours.

295
16:04.089 --> 16:06.007
-Kang has got a lot on her plate. -Got it.

296
16:06.091 --> 16:08.301
[playfully exasperated music playing]

297
16:08.426 --> 16:09.678
Ugh, jeez.

298
16:11.012 --> 16:13.139
You get the check. God…

299
16:16.267 --> 16:18.186
-That's the guy, right? -Yeah, I think so.

300
16:18.561 --> 16:20.146
-Oh, he's the one who's in that video? -What exactly happened with that?

301
16:20.230 --> 16:22.148
-Have you watched it? -He's the guy Yi-jun saved?

302
16:23.566 --> 16:25.318
-That's him. For sure. -This is surreal…

303
16:25.402 --> 16:26.569
God, seriously…

304
16:27.237 --> 16:28.488
[Yi-jun] Look out!

305
16:28.571 --> 16:31.282
-[tense music playing] -[motorcycle approaches rapidly]

306
16:34.452 --> 16:35.704
[cafe staff] Here's your order, sir.

307
16:35.787 --> 16:37.080
Right, thank you.

308
16:43.044 --> 16:46.548
KNIGHT IN SHINING ARMOR TO THE RESCUE WHAT HAPPENED AT THE AWARDS CEREMONY?

309
16:48.842 --> 16:50.427
[phone buzzes]

310
16:50.969 --> 16:52.762
LEE SI-A

311
16:56.474 --> 17:00.145
"Third-gen chaebol saves the life of his personal secretary." [chuckles]

312
17:00.228 --> 17:02.647
Oppa, you're basically a star!

313
17:02.731 --> 17:04.524
Get to the point.

314
17:04.607 --> 17:07.026
[chuckles] You must be reeling.

315
17:07.610 --> 17:08.611
Is that it?

316
17:08.695 --> 17:10.864
[Si-a] Life is like a rigged casino, oppa.

317
17:10.947 --> 17:13.992
Practically nothing ever goes the way you want it to.

318
17:14.075 --> 17:15.034
That's just how it is.

319
17:15.118 --> 17:17.162
If you're gonna rattle on like this--

320
17:17.245 --> 17:18.830
[Si-a] How long do I gotta keep waiting?

321
17:18.913 --> 17:22.250
I need an answer. You know my patience is running out.

322
17:22.333 --> 17:24.002
[sighs]

323
17:26.796 --> 17:27.881
[sighs]

324
17:28.465 --> 17:30.300
KNIGHT IN SHINING ARMOR TO THE RESCUE WHAT HAPPENED AT THE AWARDS CEREMONY?

325
17:31.092 --> 17:32.302
They're freaking out.

326
17:32.385 --> 17:35.013
We blurred the image, but people still picked you out.

327
17:35.096 --> 17:38.016
They're saying it's like a bromance movie.

328
17:38.767 --> 17:41.394
How's it feel to become an instant star overnight?

329
17:41.478 --> 17:42.771
It makes me uncomfortable.

330
17:44.689 --> 17:45.815
And I find it offensive.

331
17:47.942 --> 17:48.985
Stay there.

332
17:50.320 --> 17:51.863
Oh, yeah, I also wanted to ask,

333
17:51.946 --> 17:54.282
would you go on a blind date with Ms. Kim? She's asking.

334
17:54.365 --> 17:55.575
[quirky, tense music playing]

335
17:55.658 --> 17:56.993
Is she pretty?

336
17:57.076 --> 17:59.370
[Da-woon] Classic. That's what it always comes down to.

337
17:59.454 --> 18:00.997
What's your type, usually?

338
18:01.414 --> 18:02.832
I like people who aren't difficult,

339
18:02.916 --> 18:05.001
smile a lot, and have an innocent look to them.

340
18:05.877 --> 18:07.545
-[Da-woon] Ah. -[door opens]

341
18:07.921 --> 18:10.215
The anniversary of his mother's death's coming up.

342
18:10.298 --> 18:11.466
Brace yourself for that.

343
18:11.549 --> 18:13.176
Ten days before and after.

344
18:13.259 --> 18:14.677
That's when Mr. Yoon tends to isolate.

345
18:15.261 --> 18:17.514
Didn't she pass away when Mr. Yoon was really little?

346
18:18.181 --> 18:21.142
-Does he still struggle with it? -Probably will forever.

347
18:22.227 --> 18:23.478
I know I'd be traumatized too.

348
18:24.479 --> 18:27.482
[footsteps receding]

349
18:29.442 --> 18:31.694
[gentle, pensive music playing]

350
18:33.404 --> 18:36.074
It makes me uncomfortable. And I find it offensive.

351
18:36.783 --> 18:37.784
[sighs]

352
18:43.540 --> 18:44.415
Is she pretty?

353
18:45.291 --> 18:47.001
[gasps]

354
18:47.085 --> 18:50.129
[quirky music playing]

355
18:54.968 --> 18:56.010
[whispers] Is she pretty?

356
18:56.094 --> 18:57.095
[gasps]

357
19:01.224 --> 19:02.183
Is she pretty?

358
19:03.017 --> 19:04.102
Oh.

359
19:04.435 --> 19:06.521
[Jae-hee] Is she pretty? Is she pretty? Is she pretty?

360
19:06.604 --> 19:08.398
Is she pretty? Is she pretty?

361
19:08.481 --> 19:09.691
Is she pretty? Is she pretty?

362
19:09.774 --> 19:11.401
Is she pretty? Is she pretty? Is she pretty?

363
19:11.484 --> 19:13.987
Is she pretty? Is she pretty? Is she pretty, huh?

364
19:14.070 --> 19:15.864
[screams]

365
19:15.947 --> 19:18.366
-[music fades] -[rooster crows]

366
19:20.535 --> 19:21.661
[Ms. Kim] Mr. Jung!

367
19:21.744 --> 19:23.329
-[Da-woon] Oh, Ms. Kim. -[Ms. Kim chuckles]

368
19:23.413 --> 19:24.747
[Da-woon] Ms. Kim's from Public Relations.

369
19:24.831 --> 19:27.792
-[Jae-hee] Oh, hello, ma'am. -Hi, how are you?

370
19:27.876 --> 19:29.919
-Oh, are you going to lunch now? -[Jae-hee] Uh, yes.

371
19:30.378 --> 19:32.672
-Have you had lunch yet, Ms. Kim? -[Ms. Kim] I haven't.

372
19:32.755 --> 19:37.385
So, actually, do you wanna eat together? [chuckles]

373
19:37.468 --> 19:39.596
All right, you two. Let's get moving.

374
19:39.679 --> 19:41.890
I hope you enjoy your lunch, just the two of you.

375
19:41.973 --> 19:42.932
[Da-woon] You're so cute.

376
19:43.349 --> 19:45.351
Wow, don't they make a great couple?

377
19:45.435 --> 19:48.271
Picture perfect, honestly. Wow…

378
19:48.354 --> 19:50.857
To think I lost sleep over that little snake.

379
19:52.901 --> 19:54.569
-[Jae-hee sighs] -[awkward, whimsical music playing]

380
19:54.652 --> 19:55.653
[Jae-hee] I'm sorry.

381
19:55.737 --> 19:59.282
I turned down Mr. Jung's offer, but it seems he hasn't told you yet.

382
19:59.365 --> 20:02.118
No, I know. He said you didn't wanna go out.

383
20:02.201 --> 20:03.828
[exhales affirmatively]

384
20:03.912 --> 20:06.539
But still, I wanted to at least meet you.

385
20:06.998 --> 20:08.708
Maybe your feelings will change in the end?

386
20:10.084 --> 20:11.336
[chuckles softly]

387
20:12.003 --> 20:14.881
If we ever do go out, I promise you'll have fun.

388
20:19.761 --> 20:22.221
-[staff] Here, enjoy your meal. -[Si-hyun] Great, thank you so much!

389
20:22.847 --> 20:24.891
[pop music playing over speakers]

390
20:33.441 --> 20:35.526
[munching]

391
20:36.694 --> 20:38.947
What's this? You know what's stressing him out?

392
20:39.030 --> 20:40.615
So I guess what they say is true.

393
20:40.698 --> 20:43.952
Mr. Yoon really does start binging when he's stressed.

394
20:44.035 --> 20:45.536
Have some. It's delicious.

395
20:45.620 --> 20:48.706
Ah… it's even warm. This is right outta the oven.

396
20:49.540 --> 20:50.875
[munches]

397
20:50.959 --> 20:53.127
I wonder what you're stressed out about today.

398
20:54.545 --> 20:56.631
What about Mr. Kang? What, he's busy?

399
20:57.966 --> 21:00.343
Well, it turns out Mr. Kang's quite sought-after.

400
21:00.426 --> 21:02.095
Ms. Kim's not the only one.

401
21:02.178 --> 21:04.472
Women around the office are flocking toward him, like,

402
21:04.555 --> 21:07.433
-"Ah! He's so hot!" -Oh…

403
21:07.517 --> 21:10.687
So that must mean Mr. Kang's on a lunch date, huh? Hmm…

404
21:10.770 --> 21:12.939
And it's only gonna get worse from here, but don't worry,

405
21:13.022 --> 21:15.400
I've just put together a totally fail-proof plan.

406
21:15.984 --> 21:18.945
In order to counteract the rumors about Mr. Yoon and Mr. Kang,

407
21:19.028 --> 21:20.196
-I was thinking-- -Mm…

408
21:20.279 --> 21:22.490
Kang getting seen out on a date could fix that.

409
21:22.573 --> 21:25.952
Those bromance rumors would get shot to hell the second he's spotted.

410
21:26.035 --> 21:28.287
Hey, you're actually binging out of relief, huh?

411
21:29.747 --> 21:31.082
Man, look at him go!

412
21:31.165 --> 21:34.919
KNIGHT IN SHINING ARMOR TO THE RESCUE WHAT HAPPENED AT THE AWARDS CEREMONY?

413
21:35.003 --> 21:37.547
The man can't look at a belt without sweating.

414
21:38.339 --> 21:39.799
What is this bullshit?

415
21:39.882 --> 21:41.009
[hisses sternly]

416
21:41.092 --> 21:43.845
-What? -You need to stop harassing him.

417
21:43.928 --> 21:46.556
The anniversary's hard enough, you shouldn't be adding to it.

418
21:47.974 --> 21:50.351
Unni. You think it's easy for me?

419
21:50.435 --> 21:52.020
I struggled with it, too.

420
21:52.103 --> 21:53.646
Why does everyone pick his side?

421
21:54.522 --> 21:56.566
Hey, I'm on your side, right?

422
21:56.983 --> 21:58.151
Yi-jun's still single.

423
21:58.234 --> 21:59.944
It's not like he has a partner there to take his side.

424
22:00.611 --> 22:02.238
So you're telling me to shut up now?

425
22:02.321 --> 22:03.489
Of course not.

426
22:06.743 --> 22:10.455
What have you heard about the secretary and those recordings?

427
22:11.831 --> 22:13.166
You know about that.

428
22:14.667 --> 22:15.668
[scoffs]

429
22:16.335 --> 22:18.046
Gotta be nice not to care.

430
22:18.129 --> 22:19.213
Staying out of it,

431
22:19.297 --> 22:21.090
just keeping the peace like a good daughter.

432
22:23.926 --> 22:25.928
Why are you still reading that if it annoys you?

433
22:26.888 --> 22:28.806
You know, you've got a twisted personality.

434
22:28.890 --> 22:30.725
I can't believe he's so fawned-over,

435
22:30.808 --> 22:32.810
just for saving his stupid secretary.

436
22:32.894 --> 22:35.855
They're going on and on about how cute they are.

437
22:35.938 --> 22:37.231
They did look good together.

438
22:37.315 --> 22:39.859
[Mr. Moon and Na-jung laugh]

439
22:40.818 --> 22:42.070
Uh…

440
22:42.153 --> 22:45.948
[pensive, suspicious music playing]

441
22:55.500 --> 22:56.501
[snaps fingers]

442
22:57.335 --> 22:58.252
Unni.

443
23:00.171 --> 23:01.339
See you at the memorial.

444
23:04.425 --> 23:05.551
Where are you going now?

445
23:07.345 --> 23:09.180
I thought we were picking up Yi-jun.

446
23:10.807 --> 23:13.309
He's not coming. Leave him alone.

447
23:14.227 --> 23:15.603
[sighs]

448
23:16.729 --> 23:20.775
[laughs sinisterly]

449
23:21.943 --> 23:23.528
-Wow! -[Ms. Choi laughs]

450
23:23.611 --> 23:26.239
He seriously let him show up to work that late?

451
23:26.322 --> 23:28.449
And he personally gave him juice?

452
23:29.742 --> 23:31.452
[Jae-hee] Ah… Thank you.

453
23:31.536 --> 23:33.121
[Ms. Choi] Goodness, it was so strange

454
23:33.204 --> 23:35.623
I thought I might be seeing things. [chuckles]

455
23:37.542 --> 23:39.043
-Drink up. -[Na-jung exclaims]

456
23:40.253 --> 23:42.380
God, how could I have been so blind?

457
23:42.588 --> 23:43.673
[laughs]

458
23:44.549 --> 23:45.383
Mm.

459
23:45.466 --> 23:46.551
[chuckles softly]

460
23:47.260 --> 23:48.344
Hang on a sec.

461
23:50.429 --> 23:52.223
I doubt that prick hid it in his house,

462
23:52.306 --> 23:55.226
but check if there's a voice recording pen around.

463
23:55.309 --> 23:56.894
Oh, all right…

464
24:00.857 --> 24:02.358
One other thing.

465
24:03.317 --> 24:04.569
Yes?

466
24:07.488 --> 24:08.990
That thing you saw…

467
24:09.073 --> 24:11.117
[tense, dramatic music playing]

468
24:17.748 --> 24:19.208
[gasps]

469
24:27.175 --> 24:29.969
Uh… I didn't… I didn't tell a soul.

470
24:30.052 --> 24:32.054
I promise I didn't mention it to anyone else.

471
24:32.138 --> 24:33.181
I swear, ma'am.

472
24:34.807 --> 24:38.394
You be smart and keep that quiet.

473
24:38.477 --> 24:40.188
Mm-hmm. Yes.

474
24:40.271 --> 24:42.273
[tense, dramatic music continues]

475
24:55.995 --> 24:57.622
-Oh, my gosh! -[Seok-jin] Choi Myeong-suk.

476
24:58.206 --> 24:59.207
Detective Kim.

477
25:01.459 --> 25:02.543
Mind if we have a chat?

478
25:03.920 --> 25:04.962
[music ends]

479
25:07.715 --> 25:09.675
[Mi-jin] I'm sorry for showing up unannounced.

480
25:10.218 --> 25:12.678
Dad say anything about me not going?

481
25:12.762 --> 25:13.971
Will I get disowned?

482
25:14.055 --> 25:15.723
I think you know you should come.

483
25:19.894 --> 25:22.480
Yi-jun, listen, Mom's memorial service--

484
25:22.563 --> 25:25.483
She left that house because she couldn't stand it.

485
25:27.485 --> 25:31.322
But Father won't change the location, he wants to have it at the house.

486
25:31.405 --> 25:32.531
I hate it too.

487
25:32.615 --> 25:36.202
Even on just a regular day, so you can imagine how I feel.

488
25:36.744 --> 25:38.120
You understand, Mi-jin.

489
25:41.415 --> 25:45.878
Oh, I was talking to Na-jung, and she said something strange.

490
25:46.212 --> 25:49.590
She mentioned that your former secretary had made a recording?

491
25:51.509 --> 25:52.718
She told you all that?

492
25:53.761 --> 25:54.929
Is everything okay?

493
25:56.055 --> 25:58.641
I'm just worried you've painted yourself into a corner again.

494
26:01.769 --> 26:04.188
Stop worrying about me. You'll get wrinkles.

495
26:04.272 --> 26:05.648
[chuckles]

496
26:07.733 --> 26:10.820
[whimsical music playing]

497
26:17.493 --> 26:19.203
You did. You looked out for me.

498
26:20.579 --> 26:22.957
I couldn't get anything past him that night,

499
26:23.499 --> 26:26.252
and now that I want him to know how I feel, he's clueless.

500
26:29.672 --> 26:30.715
Is she pretty?

501
26:30.798 --> 26:32.383
"Is she pretty?"

502
26:33.259 --> 26:34.302
[scoffs]

503
26:34.385 --> 26:35.219
Yeah, duh.

504
26:35.303 --> 26:38.889
Every girl I've dated has obviously been incredibly attractive.

505
26:40.766 --> 26:43.352
Fine, let him go on his little date.

506
26:43.936 --> 26:45.604
I already know how it'll turn out.

507
26:51.527 --> 26:53.487
-I love you. -I love you.

508
26:55.156 --> 26:56.741
-Let's get married. -Okay.

509
26:56.824 --> 26:59.577
[sweeping, romantic music playing]

510
27:04.373 --> 27:08.085
[Yi-jun laughs through tears]

511
27:14.675 --> 27:15.676
[music ends]

512
27:16.677 --> 27:18.888
[cheeky music playing]

513
27:18.971 --> 27:21.724
[sighs] I hear Mr. Kang went out on a date.

514
27:22.808 --> 27:26.145
That's gotta be why you've been acting so moody, huh?

515
27:26.729 --> 27:29.190
You've been imagining their wedding, haven't you?

516
27:29.273 --> 27:32.943
Got to the honeymoon yet? Maybe don't go there. [chuckles]

517
27:35.988 --> 27:37.323
You wanted to keep him around.

518
27:38.366 --> 27:39.909
You should've seen this coming.

519
27:40.743 --> 27:43.079
You should have been more discreet in front of the press earlier.

520
27:43.162 --> 27:45.623
He was obviously in serious danger, how could I not?

521
27:46.832 --> 27:49.001
This isn't happening in a vacuum.

522
27:49.085 --> 27:50.753
If you don't keep it hidden,

523
27:51.587 --> 27:54.256
it's only a matter of time before everyone finds out.

524
27:54.340 --> 27:56.759
-[sighs] -[somber, tense music playing]

525
27:56.842 --> 27:58.677
CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE

526
27:58.761 --> 27:59.929
[phone buzzes]

527
28:00.012 --> 28:01.389
The moment of reckoning…

528
28:07.228 --> 28:08.062
[sighs]

529
28:10.064 --> 28:12.733
Putting aside the fact that you're blinded by your crush,

530
28:14.235 --> 28:15.403
how will you handle this?

531
28:15.820 --> 28:17.154
You're gonna confess?

532
28:18.364 --> 28:19.740
[sighs]

533
28:24.078 --> 28:25.079
[sighs]

534
28:27.289 --> 28:30.292
Taekang's likely heir loves his male secretary.

535
28:30.876 --> 28:33.295
I'm sure the whole world will freak out about it,

536
28:33.379 --> 28:34.588
you'll be able to ignore that.

537
28:36.340 --> 28:37.675
But what about him?

538
28:39.593 --> 28:42.096
As of now, he shows up when you summon him.

539
28:43.139 --> 28:44.265
Think he'll keep doing that?

540
28:47.476 --> 28:48.853
I just worry.

541
28:49.311 --> 28:51.605
I can't stop worrying, that's all.

542
28:53.732 --> 28:54.900
Chin up.

543
28:54.984 --> 28:56.735
[somber, tense music continues]

544
29:13.085 --> 29:14.170
[elevator chimes]

545
29:24.054 --> 29:27.892
TAEKANG GROUP CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE

546
29:32.313 --> 29:33.272
[music fades]

547
29:35.483 --> 29:37.151
He's upstairs right now.

548
29:37.985 --> 29:38.944
So, did he just go?

549
29:39.028 --> 29:41.780
Yeah, but tell me why that box warranted that chase.

550
29:42.323 --> 29:44.867
If you hadn't done that, Mr. Yoon wouldn't have gone after you.

551
29:46.118 --> 29:48.162
I had to confirm something as his secretary. That's my job.

552
29:48.245 --> 29:49.371
[sighs]

553
29:49.955 --> 29:51.332
[phone buzzes]

554
29:54.001 --> 29:56.253
[Hye-jung] Yoon Na-jung's secretarial team just informed me

555
29:56.337 --> 29:58.047
that she'll arrive in five minutes.

556
29:58.130 --> 30:00.257
She'll try to drag you into this, too.

557
30:01.008 --> 30:02.176
Brace yourself.

558
30:02.259 --> 30:03.802
[ominous music playing]

559
30:03.886 --> 30:05.721
-[elevator chimes] -[elevator door opens]

560
30:07.389 --> 30:08.933
I can't believe it's happening.

561
30:10.893 --> 30:14.480
The Na-jung era has begun. [chuckles]

562
30:15.439 --> 30:17.233
[whistling]

563
30:17.316 --> 30:18.275
Oh.

564
30:20.986 --> 30:22.154
[snickers]

565
30:22.571 --> 30:24.031
I knew it…

566
30:24.114 --> 30:25.824
You're too pretty for a guy.

567
30:26.700 --> 30:28.702
[chuckles]

568
30:28.827 --> 30:31.580
It turns out blood isn't thicker than water after all.

569
30:31.664 --> 30:33.999
[tense music playing]

570
30:34.792 --> 30:36.710
I didn't know this about my brother…

571
30:37.920 --> 30:39.755
What a fun surprise.

572
30:42.466 --> 30:43.676
Are you the one who flirted?

573
30:45.511 --> 30:47.179
Or did Yoon Yi-jun hit on you?

574
30:47.888 --> 30:49.640
These insinuations are vulgar.

575
30:49.723 --> 30:53.227
Whoever made the first move, I'm thankful for it.

576
30:53.310 --> 30:54.562
'Cause he's screwed.

577
30:56.939 --> 31:00.192
[Mr. Na] Crisis Management's doing what it can to suppress the footage,

578
31:00.276 --> 31:02.236
but it's spreading faster than we anticipated,

579
31:02.319 --> 31:04.029
and things are starting to get out of hand.

580
31:05.614 --> 31:07.866
Thanks to your stupid, reckless behavior,

581
31:07.950 --> 31:09.994
you've yet again tarnished our good name.

582
31:11.579 --> 31:14.248
We'll need to find a way to restore our image.

583
31:14.331 --> 31:16.000
-I'll think of something. -[Tae-sik] Hmm.

584
31:16.083 --> 31:17.585
[tense music continues]

585
31:22.506 --> 31:24.925
Be an adult, and fix this.

586
31:28.804 --> 31:32.808
What about the marketing newsletter, and what is the distribution plan?

587
31:33.309 --> 31:35.269
The secretary's office is preparing it.

588
31:35.352 --> 31:36.770
I'll be briefing the chairman.

589
31:36.854 --> 31:38.147
No need for that.

590
31:40.024 --> 31:42.067
I can handle the briefing on my own.

591
31:49.825 --> 31:52.036
Given my prominent public profile,

592
31:52.119 --> 31:54.580
and despite your efforts to curtail exposure,

593
31:54.663 --> 31:58.834
the current response we're seeing in online communities has been explosive.

594
31:58.917 --> 32:00.419
Sales for the Taekang Electronics

595
32:00.502 --> 32:02.338
Series Seven mobile phone and wearable device,

596
32:02.421 --> 32:04.965
which I was wearing while saving my secretary,

597
32:05.049 --> 32:06.175
have seen an increase.

598
32:06.258 --> 32:09.595
Additionally, sales of the Taekang CV90 I rode to the event

599
32:09.678 --> 32:11.263
have surged by billions.

600
32:11.805 --> 32:14.516
The clothes and shoes I wore when I was spotted,

601
32:14.600 --> 32:17.061
that are sold exclusively at Taekang department stores,

602
32:17.144 --> 32:18.937
are currently selling out steadily,

603
32:19.688 --> 32:21.357
which should help with the Italian HQ contract renewal.

604
32:21.440 --> 32:24.568
You'll have leverage going into negotiations, all because of this.

605
32:24.652 --> 32:26.487
[slick, confident music playing]

606
32:26.570 --> 32:29.365
We've been spending tens of billions on company PR per year.

607
32:29.448 --> 32:30.699
Just consider that.

608
32:31.325 --> 32:34.119
This is gonna do a lot more for us than that award.

609
32:35.371 --> 32:36.914
[phone buzzes]

610
32:38.499 --> 32:40.668
Oh, I almost forgot.

611
32:41.543 --> 32:43.045
There's a story involving a man

612
32:43.128 --> 32:45.839
who visited Fantasy Land with his elderly mother.

613
32:45.923 --> 32:48.717
His comments and photos are going viral.

614
32:52.805 --> 32:56.266
Just goes to show it's important to be kind to strangers.

615
32:56.350 --> 32:58.394
I guess good deeds are rewarded.

616
33:03.232 --> 33:04.191
[music ends]

617
33:08.987 --> 33:10.489
The memorial is today.

618
33:11.907 --> 33:13.492
I'm planning on attending.

619
33:15.160 --> 33:17.371
There's something I definitely need for you to hear.

620
33:17.454 --> 33:20.165
[dramatic music playing]

621
33:27.881 --> 33:30.300
[dramatic music swells, fades]

622
33:30.884 --> 33:32.428
Do you have any proof against him?

623
33:32.803 --> 33:34.680
Uh-huh. Back off.

624
33:35.806 --> 33:36.765
[scoffs]

625
33:37.349 --> 33:38.308
Well, I do.

626
33:39.351 --> 33:40.227
I have proof.

627
33:40.477 --> 33:42.438
[tense music playing]

628
33:42.521 --> 33:43.605
[scoffs]

629
33:49.945 --> 33:51.029
What do you think of this?

630
33:55.868 --> 33:57.536
I don't see my face anywhere.

631
33:58.454 --> 34:00.289
I've checked with the delivery company.

632
34:00.914 --> 34:03.417
What do you think, should I go to the police now?

633
34:04.793 --> 34:09.006
[snickers] Who knows? This might not be your first rodeo.

634
34:10.215 --> 34:12.760
Technically, that box was what set everything off.

635
34:13.343 --> 34:14.762
You're still going in there?

636
34:15.596 --> 34:16.638
[scoffs]

637
34:17.222 --> 34:18.640
You're pissing me off, know that?

638
34:20.434 --> 34:24.396
Hey. Maybe I did it, so what? Huh?

639
34:25.856 --> 34:28.275
You really think you can do anything?

640
34:30.110 --> 34:33.405
Hey, Na-jung. I got that box you sent me.

641
34:33.489 --> 34:36.408
[tense music continues]

642
34:51.131 --> 34:52.132
[music ends]

643
34:54.218 --> 34:55.219
[door closes]

644
34:56.386 --> 34:58.180
How did you get your hands on that footage?

645
34:58.764 --> 35:01.350
Why would you put yourself in danger by digging around like that?

646
35:01.433 --> 35:04.561
I asked for permission from the venue, I couldn't just let it slide.

647
35:05.145 --> 35:07.314
I meant to tell you before, but things got complicated.

648
35:07.981 --> 35:10.984
She obviously planned to ruin your reputation with the rumors,

649
35:11.068 --> 35:13.612
so I knew I had to stop her before she could enter his office.

650
35:14.404 --> 35:17.324
Rumors? Just what are you saying?

651
35:17.407 --> 35:20.285
They would have been detrimental to both of us, sir.

652
35:21.119 --> 35:22.996
I had to fix things while I still could.

653
35:25.249 --> 35:27.751
I did whatever I had to do to save you.

654
35:28.877 --> 35:31.129
I don't give a damn what they say.

655
35:34.633 --> 35:36.093
Get ready and meet me out there.

656
35:36.176 --> 35:37.928
We gotta leave now. We're cutting it close.

657
35:43.350 --> 35:44.810
[sighs]

658
35:50.399 --> 35:52.192
[gasps]

659
35:53.151 --> 35:55.529
What happened? You just had a fight with Na-jung, right?

660
35:55.612 --> 35:56.697
Wow.

661
35:57.072 --> 35:59.575
I honestly don't understand it. How do you know about everything?

662
35:59.658 --> 36:03.453
Just be honest. There are a lot of rumors.

663
36:03.537 --> 36:04.913
Yi-jun's in love with you, isn't he?

664
36:06.498 --> 36:09.084
And judging by the way you're rushing to close the case,

665
36:09.167 --> 36:11.336
acting as if your whole life depends on it,

666
36:11.795 --> 36:13.005
you've already caught on.

667
36:14.423 --> 36:15.465
[sighs]

668
36:15.549 --> 36:17.092
Ugh, God!

669
36:17.175 --> 36:19.094
Hey, even though you're a guy?

670
36:20.012 --> 36:23.473
I mean, you're a girl, not a guy, but you know what I mean.

671
36:23.557 --> 36:25.517
He sees you as a guy, doesn't he?

672
36:25.601 --> 36:28.687
He won't do that from now on, and he shouldn't.

673
36:29.730 --> 36:31.565
You know he's got quite a lot to lose.

674
36:31.648 --> 36:33.775
Jae-hee, it won't work.

675
36:33.859 --> 36:35.277
You understand that, right?

676
36:35.360 --> 36:36.403
No way in hell.

677
36:38.155 --> 36:39.031
Don't worry, Wan-gu.

678
36:39.114 --> 36:40.365
[sighs]

679
36:41.325 --> 36:43.327
[soft, pensive music playing]

680
36:47.331 --> 36:49.583
Are you okay? Did you get hurt?

681
36:50.334 --> 36:51.960
Don't ever do that again.

682
36:52.836 --> 36:54.755
Stop jumping into harm's way like that.

683
36:55.339 --> 36:56.632
It's not worth it.

684
36:58.592 --> 37:02.346
It would be so much easier to stop caring if he didn't have a good side.

685
37:03.138 --> 37:04.348
[sighs]

686
37:04.932 --> 37:07.517
I did whatever I had to do to save you.

687
37:08.602 --> 37:10.604
I don't give a damn what they say.

688
37:12.731 --> 37:16.944
[sighs] How can you let every word he says jerk you around like this, Kang Jae-hee?

689
37:18.862 --> 37:19.988
Get it together.

690
37:23.116 --> 37:24.409
[sighs deeply]

691
37:24.493 --> 37:25.953
[employee 1] Hey, wait a minute…

692
37:26.620 --> 37:28.997
Isn't Jae-hee already seeing someone?

693
37:29.081 --> 37:30.415
[employee 2] Yeah, I thought so.

694
37:30.499 --> 37:32.459
You said he turned down the date at first,

695
37:32.542 --> 37:34.795
so then why did he end up having lunch with you?

696
37:34.878 --> 37:36.296
[Ms. Kim sighs] I have no idea.

697
37:36.380 --> 37:38.215
He apologized for declining,

698
37:38.298 --> 37:40.676
but he was so polite it was honestly annoying.

699
37:40.759 --> 37:41.969
What was it?

700
37:42.052 --> 37:45.180
He unintentionally used me so he could protect himself, or whatever.

701
37:45.973 --> 37:47.015
[employee 1] Sounds like nonsense to me.

702
37:47.182 --> 37:48.433
[Ms. Kim] Yeah, it was ridiculous.

703
37:51.937 --> 37:55.190
I hereby crown you this month's "King of Clean"!

704
37:55.273 --> 37:57.985
Binny, Binny, Binny, Binny!

705
37:58.068 --> 38:00.362
[all cheering]

706
38:00.445 --> 38:03.156
-I'd like to thank our chief, coworkers. -Aw…

707
38:03.240 --> 38:05.575
I couldn't have done any of this without you.

708
38:06.868 --> 38:08.954
I pledge in front of all of you here,

709
38:09.037 --> 38:12.457
going forward, Jung Wan… "Binny,"

710
38:12.958 --> 38:17.254
will continue to wage war against the scourge of mold!

711
38:17.337 --> 38:19.214
-[all cheering] -[upbeat music playing]

712
38:19.297 --> 38:21.383
-Eradicate! -[all] Eradicate!

713
38:25.387 --> 38:28.223
Binny's got us all covered today, eat up, everyone.

714
38:28.306 --> 38:29.266
My pleasure, guys!

715
38:29.349 --> 38:30.600
[all cheering]

716
38:30.684 --> 38:33.186
[upbeat music continues]

717
38:36.982 --> 38:38.525
[music stops]

718
38:40.360 --> 38:42.112
Not much.

719
38:42.195 --> 38:44.448
Okay, Binny, let's get a photo of you.

720
38:44.531 --> 38:45.741
[chuckles]

721
38:45.824 --> 38:47.743
Okay, smile.

722
38:47.826 --> 38:48.869
Whoa, wait, hang on.

723
38:49.995 --> 38:51.663
I gotta be cautious with these things.

724
38:52.080 --> 38:55.584
Seriously, I don't want anyone to use my likeness or anything like that.

725
38:56.168 --> 38:57.627
You might be the King of Clean,

726
38:57.711 --> 39:00.714
but you're a little full of yourself if I do say so.

727
39:00.797 --> 39:02.007
[Young-sook chuckles] But regardless…

728
39:02.090 --> 39:04.885
to continue the sacred janitorial staff tradition,

729
39:04.968 --> 39:06.136
here you go.

730
39:07.471 --> 39:08.430
Wait, what is this?

731
39:09.556 --> 39:12.100
It's the Taekang King of Clean Historical Record.

732
39:15.228 --> 39:16.063
[Wan-gu] Huh?

733
39:16.146 --> 39:17.022
CLEANING KING OF THE MONTH NOVEMBER

734
39:17.105 --> 39:18.065
Wait, who's this?

735
39:18.148 --> 39:20.692
Mm. That's Mr. Kim.

736
39:21.485 --> 39:24.654
Huh, what floor's he on? Why have I never seen the guy before?

737
39:25.113 --> 39:26.031
He's not here today?

738
39:26.114 --> 39:28.825
Mm-hmm. Yeah, that guy quit right before you joined us.

739
39:28.909 --> 39:30.327
Huh, is that so?

740
39:31.244 --> 39:33.205
Do you know why he's all covered up like this?

741
39:33.288 --> 39:37.209
Actually… I believe he's got tattoos everywhere.

742
39:37.959 --> 39:39.294
Tattoos?

743
39:39.377 --> 39:41.004
You know, I asked him about it,

744
39:41.088 --> 39:44.132
he told me he covered up because he didn't wanna look scary.

745
39:44.216 --> 39:45.842
[unsettling music playing]

746
39:45.926 --> 39:47.135
They said he was from Taekang,

747
39:47.219 --> 39:50.972
so at first, when I saw him, I was a little biased against him.

748
39:51.056 --> 39:54.434
But then it turned out he was a very quiet fellow,

749
39:54.518 --> 39:55.644
and he did just great.

750
39:55.727 --> 39:57.854
[Young-chun] Ugh, he quit during, you know, that thing,

751
39:57.938 --> 40:00.023
and we didn't get to throw a goodbye party either.

752
40:00.107 --> 40:01.149
[Young-sook] Mm-hmm.

753
40:01.233 --> 40:02.234
What thing?

754
40:02.984 --> 40:04.486
-Oh, the-- -[Young-sook] Oh, you know what I mean.

755
40:05.278 --> 40:08.323
The TF Team secretary thing. All that chaos…

756
40:08.406 --> 40:09.616
Oh…

757
40:09.699 --> 40:11.034
[Young-chun] Man, oh, man…

758
40:12.160 --> 40:14.162
-Let's drink. -[Young-sook] Mm-hmm.

759
40:14.246 --> 40:16.581
-Refill. -Okay… Here…

760
40:20.669 --> 40:23.505
CLEANING KING OF THE MONTH NOVEMBER

761
40:23.588 --> 40:24.589
[music ends]

762
40:34.391 --> 40:37.477
So-mi, was that her name? Did you enjoy your meal?

763
40:39.104 --> 40:40.105
Yes.

764
40:40.480 --> 40:41.314
You're into her?

765
40:42.440 --> 40:44.484
Tell me. You wanna date her?

766
40:46.611 --> 40:47.779
I'll think about it.

767
40:54.286 --> 40:57.038
[gentle music playing]

768
42:00.727 --> 42:03.021
[gentle music continues]

769
42:30.298 --> 42:31.424
[music ends]

770
42:31.508 --> 42:32.968
[Jae-hee] Do you think about your mother a lot?

771
42:37.639 --> 42:38.640
Never mind.

772
42:46.982 --> 42:47.941
Sometimes…

773
42:52.153 --> 42:54.990
Whenever I see a belt, I think of that day.

774
43:00.120 --> 43:01.454
Sometimes people…

775
43:02.789 --> 43:04.666
make a bad decision they can't undo.

776
43:07.877 --> 43:09.129
That's how I think of it now,

777
43:10.547 --> 43:12.590
as a very wrong decision.

778
43:12.674 --> 43:14.676
[subdued, light music playing]

779
43:22.100 --> 43:23.226
[young Na-jung] Yi-jun, wait!

780
43:23.810 --> 43:26.104
Mom said not to interrupt her when she's drawing.

781
43:26.187 --> 43:27.522
Shush.

782
43:27.605 --> 43:29.482
"Ta-da!" That's what we'll say.

783
43:29.566 --> 43:30.859
It'll be fun.

784
43:31.109 --> 43:32.068
She'll like it.

785
43:33.611 --> 43:37.240
[keys jangling]

786
43:37.324 --> 43:39.909
[tense, somber music playing]

787
43:43.288 --> 43:44.122
Mom!

788
43:46.124 --> 43:47.334
[Yi-jun] She suffered from depression.

789
43:50.837 --> 43:54.299
Looking back on it, I realize Na-jung was only 11 years old at the time.

790
43:54.382 --> 43:55.759
Get over here!

791
43:57.552 --> 43:59.846
[Yi-jun] If I hadn't opened that door…

792
43:59.929 --> 44:01.639
[somber piano music playing]

793
44:01.723 --> 44:04.267
…she wouldn't have that image seared into her memory.

794
44:04.351 --> 44:05.393
Na-jung.

795
44:06.144 --> 44:07.228
It's okay.

796
44:08.271 --> 44:09.189
It's all right.

797
44:10.231 --> 44:12.859
[Yi-jun] And she wouldn't have to live with the fact…

798
44:13.860 --> 44:16.196
that her father would always place her second.

799
44:18.531 --> 44:19.616
Ever since then…

800
44:20.325 --> 44:22.744
I've wanted to hide from the world.

801
44:23.912 --> 44:25.622
I find comfort in silence.

802
44:26.956 --> 44:28.917
I told myself, as long as I keep quiet…

803
44:30.460 --> 44:32.504
nothing like that will ever happen again.

804
44:35.340 --> 44:37.342
Which is what you wanted all along.

805
44:37.425 --> 44:38.426
I don't.

806
44:40.678 --> 44:42.430
I don't want you to be silent.

807
44:42.514 --> 44:44.682
Sir, I'm just interested in your safety.

808
44:50.563 --> 44:51.815
I can't explain.

809
44:54.484 --> 44:55.944
Ever since I met you…

810
44:58.113 --> 45:00.782
I haven't been able to hide my feelings.

811
45:00.865 --> 45:03.201
[tender, heartfelt music playing]

812
45:03.284 --> 45:04.953
The more I try to ignore it,

813
45:06.746 --> 45:08.081
the clearer it becomes.

814
45:11.251 --> 45:12.544
I make it obvious.

815
45:14.212 --> 45:16.214
And I think you already know how I feel.

816
45:19.634 --> 45:21.177
You can tell I have feelings for you.

817
45:22.846 --> 45:24.180
You've been fully aware.

818
45:26.474 --> 45:28.184
You've just pretended not to know.

819
45:29.352 --> 45:30.270
It's cowardly.

820
45:31.020 --> 45:32.480
I did what I had to do.

821
45:36.359 --> 45:37.735
Here's the thing,

822
45:40.405 --> 45:41.823
if, hypothetically…

823
45:45.743 --> 45:47.537
I decided to call off my wedding…

824
45:50.498 --> 45:51.708
would that change things?

825
45:54.043 --> 45:55.670
If I renounced my title,

826
45:55.753 --> 45:58.381
if I left Taekang and became a normal civilian,

827
46:00.091 --> 46:01.468
would that change anything?

828
46:03.178 --> 46:05.180
[tender, heartfelt music continues]

829
46:05.597 --> 46:08.391
Didn't you tell me you wanted to keep me around for a long time?

830
46:10.560 --> 46:12.395
I want you to know I feel the same way.

831
46:14.355 --> 46:15.815
So hypothetically…

832
46:17.734 --> 46:18.818
if things were different…

833
46:22.614 --> 46:24.741
if one of us were a different gender…

834
46:28.786 --> 46:30.246
if one of us were a woman…

835
46:34.792 --> 46:36.544
would you want to be together?

836
46:38.922 --> 46:41.799
I thought you told me that you weren't a fan of hypotheticals.

837
46:41.883 --> 46:43.843
And even if that were the case…

838
46:44.469 --> 46:45.428
that won't ever happen.

839
46:47.639 --> 46:49.474
I said I'd keep you safe.

840
46:50.767 --> 46:53.186
And sir, I never promised that I'd develop feelings for you.

841
46:58.107 --> 46:59.734
Then why do I feel…

842
47:02.820 --> 47:05.323
as though you also have deeper feelings for me?

843
47:14.499 --> 47:15.959
[music ends]

844
47:30.014 --> 47:33.017
[gentle romantic music playing]

845
48:29.991 --> 48:32.994
[gentle romantic music continues]

846
48:34.245 --> 48:35.538
Of course I don't.

847
48:42.712 --> 48:43.755
Are you nervous?

848
48:44.589 --> 48:46.007
I'm not nervous, not at all.

849
48:49.135 --> 48:50.386
Are you sure?

850
48:50.470 --> 48:51.971
Well, I don't feel anything special at all.

851
48:52.055 --> 48:54.057
-What do you-- -Want me to prove it to you?

852
48:58.102 --> 48:59.354
[Jae-hee grunts]

853
48:59.437 --> 49:00.897
What do you think you're doing?

854
49:00.980 --> 49:02.607
We can do that over and over,

855
49:03.483 --> 49:04.984
and I still wouldn't feel a thing.

856
49:06.235 --> 49:08.029
Honestly… [sighs]

857
49:09.197 --> 49:10.698
If you and I'd never met,

858
49:12.825 --> 49:15.370
I could've gone my whole life and never had these feelings.

859
49:19.457 --> 49:22.418
Let's just pretend none of this ever happened.

860
49:38.142 --> 49:39.143
[music ends]

861
49:40.228 --> 49:41.729
[sighs]

862
49:44.107 --> 49:44.941
I'll let myself in.

863
49:49.153 --> 49:50.697
If you keep up this attitude…

864
49:51.739 --> 49:53.658
you'll give me no choice but to resign.

865
49:54.242 --> 49:55.952
So you're threatening me now?

866
49:56.536 --> 49:58.162
You're gonna claim abuse of power?

867
49:58.246 --> 50:00.415
You really think that'll push me away?

868
50:00.498 --> 50:02.583
Can you afford to waste time like this?

869
50:02.667 --> 50:04.043
The money they hid…

870
50:05.002 --> 50:06.295
weren't you gonna try to find it?

871
50:07.922 --> 50:10.466
You lured the police with the pen voice recorder.

872
50:10.550 --> 50:12.301
The chandelier, the milk, the belt.

873
50:12.385 --> 50:14.053
Your life's been threatened a lot.

874
50:15.138 --> 50:16.931
You need to start facing reality.

875
50:17.432 --> 50:19.058
You're in an incredibly dangerous position.

876
50:19.142 --> 50:21.978
If I could do that, I wouldn't be acting so crazy.

877
50:24.105 --> 50:26.816
[breathing shakily]

878
50:27.400 --> 50:28.776
[exhales sharply]

879
50:29.902 --> 50:32.989
[gentle emotional music playing]

880
50:38.202 --> 50:39.662
Honestly…

881
50:41.914 --> 50:43.958
you're my reality, Jae-hee.

882
50:46.169 --> 50:47.253
I…

883
50:49.714 --> 50:51.340
I like you, Kang Jae-hee.

884
50:55.386 --> 50:56.220
[exhales softly]

885
51:10.610 --> 51:13.988
[tense, dramatic music playing]

886
51:30.838 --> 51:31.756
[Mr. Moon] Honey.

887
52:01.035 --> 52:03.538
[suspenseful music playing]

888
52:06.457 --> 52:07.708
What's wrong, sir?

889
52:15.216 --> 52:16.467
Quick, shift it to neutral.

890
52:18.010 --> 52:19.470
Oh, God… it's not working.

891
52:24.141 --> 52:25.142
Sir, watch out!

892
52:25.977 --> 52:27.019
[Yi-jun] Kang Jae-hee.

893
52:31.858 --> 52:34.235
[tires screeching]

894
52:35.152 --> 52:36.988
[cars collide]

895
52:45.621 --> 52:47.206
[crashing]

896
52:48.291 --> 52:51.085
[suspenseful music intensifies]

897
52:57.300 --> 53:00.386
[sinister music playing]

898
53:00.469 --> 53:03.764
CCTV RECORDING IN PROGRESS ON STANDBY 24 HOURS

899
53:22.825 --> 53:23.951
-[thuds] -[man grunts]

900
53:24.035 --> 53:26.037
[tense music playing]

901
53:28.998 --> 53:31.250
It's you, isn't it? The perp.

902
53:32.710 --> 53:34.253
I won't let him get hurt.

903
53:41.594 --> 53:44.639
[both grunting]

904
53:44.722 --> 53:47.433
[tense action music playing]

905
53:56.108 --> 53:57.902
[groaning]

906
54:10.539 --> 54:12.208
Don't you dare even try!

907
54:14.043 --> 54:15.586
[grunts]

908
54:19.423 --> 54:22.009
[distant siren wailing]

909
54:25.137 --> 54:26.222
-[both grunting] -[metal clattering]

910
54:26.305 --> 54:28.808
[grunts]

911
54:29.433 --> 54:30.768
[tense action music continues]

912
54:30.851 --> 54:33.020
[siren wailing]

913
54:38.067 --> 54:39.735
[both grunt]

914
54:45.950 --> 54:48.369
[groans]

915
54:54.125 --> 54:57.211
[panting]

916
54:59.839 --> 55:02.717
[siren wailing]

917
55:06.554 --> 55:09.515
[somber music playing]

918
55:38.044 --> 55:39.503
Ladies and gentlemen,

919
55:40.087 --> 55:43.966
let us begin the memorial service for Na Ji-hyun Michaela.

920
55:44.633 --> 55:48.220
In the name of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit,

921
55:48.721 --> 55:49.597
Amen.

922
55:52.725 --> 55:54.560
My dear brothers and sisters,

923
55:55.061 --> 55:59.482
we are gathered here today to remember our beloved Na Ji-hyun Michaela.

924
56:00.274 --> 56:02.693
Tonight, we will reflect on her memory…

925
56:02.777 --> 56:04.737
-[phone buzzes] -…she whose soul is now with God,

926
56:05.321 --> 56:06.697
in hopes of finding solace…

927
56:06.781 --> 56:07.615
I'VE SECURED THE RECORDING PEN

928
56:07.698 --> 56:10.242
…and of arriving at a sense of greater peace,

929
56:10.326 --> 56:12.828
so as to live in a way that honors her.

930
56:12.912 --> 56:14.914
[somber music continues]

931
56:20.503 --> 56:21.879
ROAD CLOSURE

932
56:22.755 --> 56:24.965
[somber music continues]

933
56:28.511 --> 56:30.346
[groaning]

934
56:30.429 --> 56:32.932
You all right, sir? Can you hear me, sir?

935
56:33.015 --> 56:34.600
[gasps]

936
56:34.683 --> 56:36.560
-[groans] -Oh, please don't get up now.

937
56:36.644 --> 56:39.063
Are you in any pain, sir?

938
56:39.146 --> 56:40.940
Jae-hee… where'd he go?

939
56:41.023 --> 56:43.067
-There was someone else in the car. -Oh.

940
56:43.150 --> 56:45.194
We've just finished giving first aid to the passenger.

941
56:45.277 --> 56:46.529
Okay.

942
56:47.071 --> 56:49.365
Is he hurt at all? Was he injured?

943
56:49.698 --> 56:51.367
[paramedic] Uh, the injuries are quite severe,

944
56:51.450 --> 56:52.868
so we'll be heading to the hospital.

945
56:52.952 --> 56:54.787
Do you know the legal name of this woman?

946
56:57.998 --> 57:00.209
Am I… Woman?

947
57:02.795 --> 57:04.505
Wait a minute! [panting]

948
57:05.965 --> 57:07.842
[pensive, tense music playing]

949
57:24.692 --> 57:28.529
[Yi-jun] Special Forces, you must've been misunderstood a lot in the military.

950
57:29.321 --> 57:31.991
No one's ever told you that you're beautiful?

951
57:34.827 --> 57:35.703
What are you doing?

952
57:35.786 --> 57:37.997
I'm… being your human clothing rack, sir.

953
57:38.080 --> 57:39.665
I get that.

954
57:39.748 --> 57:42.334
But I want to know why my rack is facing away.

955
57:42.418 --> 57:43.794
Special Forces, are you okay?

956
57:45.588 --> 57:47.381
You're still being a prude, huh?

957
57:47.464 --> 57:49.758
[dramatic music playing]

958
57:55.264 --> 57:58.809
When we first met, I said I would've fallen for you if you were a woman.

959
58:00.186 --> 58:02.354
So, would you really have fallen for me…

960
58:04.273 --> 58:05.566
if that was the truth?

961
58:06.775 --> 58:09.486
[Jae-hee] It is pointless to make assumptions.

962
58:10.946 --> 58:13.741
[dramatic music continues]

963
58:48.984 --> 58:51.904
CLEANING KING OF THE MONTH

964
58:55.908 --> 58:57.910
SPECIAL THANKS TO CHOI HEE-JIN, JUNG YOO-MIN FOR THEIR SPECIAL APPEARANCE

965
59:02.539 --> 59:03.791
[Yi-jun] Why would he do that?

966
59:03.874 --> 59:05.668
Kang Jae-hee. I want to be with you.

967
59:05.751 --> 59:06.585
[Jae-hee] I'm in love with…

968
59:06.669 --> 59:09.421
So you were too clingy and scared her off?

969
59:09.505 --> 59:11.048
[sobs] That's not how it went!

970
59:11.131 --> 59:12.466
You're outta your mind.

971
59:12.549 --> 59:15.261
Why didn't you tell me? You lost the pen on purpose?

972
59:15.344 --> 59:17.137
I started to feel worse and worse every day.

973
59:17.930 --> 59:19.265
How'd you get attached like that?

974
59:19.348 --> 59:22.101
You should have at least told me when I confessed my feelings to you.

975
59:22.434 --> 59:23.936
I was being a coward, sir.

976
59:24.395 --> 59:25.980
[Tae-sik] Go and announce your marriage.

977
59:26.355 --> 59:28.357
-[Yi-jun] Jae-hee's with me. -[camera shutters clicking rapidly]

978
59:28.440 --> 59:30.401
So stop harassing her.
